WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.112
Military Police Complaints Commission.

00:00:03.062 --> 00:00:06.850
Three formal complaints were filed and all were rejected.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:15.200
The Whelan complaint exposed CFNIS misconduct so egregious that the Ontario Superior Court stated it shocks the conscience.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:22.375
The MPCC's refusal to investigate forms the basis for the section 504 private prosecution.
